## 7. 后端接口补充（Express）

### 7.1 Integrations
- GET    /api/integrations
- POST   /api/integrations/:provider/connect      （启动授权/保存 token）
- POST   /api/integrations/:integrationId/refresh （刷新 token）
- DELETE /api/integrations/:integrationId         （断开）

### 7.2 SyncTargets（选择写入目标）
- GET    /api/integrations/:integrationId/targets
- POST   /api/integrations/:integrationId/targets  （创建/设默认）
- PATCH  /api/targets/:targetId                    （更新 mapping/默认）

### 7.3 Presets
- GET    /api/presets
- POST   /api/presets
- PATCH  /api/presets/:presetId
- DELETE /api/presets/:presetId
- POST   /api/presets/:presetId/default

### 7.4 Publish（dry-run + execute）
- POST   /api/publish/dry-run
Request:
{
  "session_id":"s1",
  "artifact_id":"a_draft_3",
  "preset_id":"p_default"
}
Response:
{ "ok": true, "risks": [...], "execution_plan": [...] }

- POST   /api/publish/execute
Request:
{
  "session_id":"s1",
  "artifact_id":"a_draft_3",
  "preset_id":"p_default"
}
Response:
{
  "ok": true,
  "results": [{ "step_id":"...", "status":"success", "external_id":"..." }],
  "publish_record_artifact": { ... }
}

### 7.5 同步日志
- GET /api/sync-logs?limit=50
- POST /api/sync-logs/:logId/retry

